                <mxCell id="57" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Thread Workspaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Workspace is a thread-local interface that abstracts the complexity of the Bridges. It provides a clean, specialized API for a thread to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;167&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Dispatch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; outgoing data or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;193&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Collect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; incoming data from its assigned Bridges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-150" y="-252" width="310" height="242" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="59" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Thread Bridges (Channels)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 7.2px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Bridges act as the centralized synchronization points between two specific threads. Each bridge encapsulates a set of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;150&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;double-buffered queues&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); scrollbar-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;, ensuring that data can be dispatched and consumed simultaneously without race conditions or memory contention.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-480" y="-251" width="310" height="241" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
