                <mxCell id="401" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Assets&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;asset&#39;s Dictionary key, type string, represents a identifier or more specificaly&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;AssetIO.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;AssetInfo.RelativePath&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;textureAssets is the only SortedDictionary, because it sorts them by the identifier, in result it keeps the assets similar closest and making possibly similar textures exist in the same atlas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FinalizeAssets&lt;/b&gt;() – transforms stored AssetIO.AssetInfo into Assets (&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;TextureAsset, AtlasAsset&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(if &lt;b&gt;makeAtlases&lt;/b&gt; is true)&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;AudioAsset&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;XnbAsset&lt;/font&gt;) and passes them into AssetBridge and awaits resources from it and then constructs data entries." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
