                <mxCell id="545" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Creating Entity&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;• Allocates a slot at the end of the container.&lt;br&gt;• The new Entity is not updated until the next tick&lt;br&gt;• Entity is created instantly&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
